    <p class="title is-5 mathjax">
      
        DAOpt: Modeling and Evaluation of Data-Driven Optimization under Uncertainty with LLMs
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Zhu%2C+W">WenZhuo Zhu</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Cui%2C+Z">Zheng Cui</a>, 
      
