        LLMs for Bayesian Optimization in Scientific Domains: Are We There Yet?
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Gupta%2C+R">Rushil Gupta</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Hartford%2C+J">Jason Hartford</a>, 
      
