        An LLM-based Agentic Framework for Accessible Network Control
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Lin%2C+S">Samuel Lin</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Zhou%2C+J">Jiawei Zhou</a>, 
      
